_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Planning helper instrumentation troubleshooting**\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Planning Gradle rerun with adjusted helper**\\\"}]}\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"## Human intervention needed\\n\\nThe automated job failed during `setup/normal_setup()` while preparing the existing `6.0.2` test suite for `org.springframework:spring-context:6.0.4`; it did not reach test generation, native-image repair, or metrics collection.\\n\\nPreserved work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9929-fails-native-image-run-org.springframework-spring-context-6.0.4-18918875\\n\\nThe likely blocker is the metadata-generation setup task. `fixTestNativeImageRun` invokes `generatePredefinedCglibProxyClasses`, but that Java task is instrumented by the Native Image agent. Spring then treats the JVM as image code and throws `UnsupportedOperationException: CGLIB runtime enhancement not supported on native image` while trying to generate `ConfigurationClassEnhancerInnerBeanMethodInterceptorTest$CglibProxyConfiguration$$SpringCGLIB$$0`. No `6.0.4` test project, metadata, publication metrics, or dynamic-access coverage was produced.\\n\\nInspect:\\n- `logs/org.springframework:spring-context:6.0.4/native-image-run-fix/fixTestNativeImageRun-2026-10-07T00-54-25-830997Z.log`\\n- `logs/org.springframework:spring-context:6.0.4/library-preparation-preflight/claude-code.log`\\n- `logs/org.springframework:spring-context:6.0.4/library-preparation-preflight/claude-code-session-or9bp1e9.log`\\n\\nManual next steps:\\n1. Reproduce the logged `fixTestNativeImageRun` command and adjust the CGLIB pre-generation task so it runs as a normal JVM process rather than under Native Image agent instrumentation.\\n2. Rerun the `6.0.4` coordinate through metadata generation and the full native test to expose and diagnose the original runtime failure.\\n3. Once tests pass, regenerate and validate metadata, dynamic-access coverage, and execution metrics before publication.\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0c80c21d7c1aa0f3016ac598acfe4487d0b1512e7297a21725\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 6463, \"output\": 954, \"cacheRead\": 67840, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 516, \"totalTokens\": 75257, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0.025852, \"output\": 0.019080000000000003, \"cacheRead\": 0.027136000000000004, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0.07206800000000001}}, \"stopReason\": \"stop\", \"timestamp\": 1791334560478, \"responseId\": \"resp_0c80c21d7c1aa0f3016ac598a11b2887d08fe689f76baad825\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}, \"toolResults\": []}\n\n[Showing lines 688-698 of 698 (50.0KB limit). Full output: /tmp/pi-bash-17b025ca0bee144b.log]"}], "details": {"truncation": {"content": "human-intervention-logs/org.springframework:spring-context:6.0.4/failure-analysis/pi-generation-2026-10-07T00-55-27-085810Z.log:4451:[recv] {\"type\": \"turn_end\", \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"thinking\", \"thinking\": \"**Inspecting continuation marker and metrics location**\", \"thinkingSignature\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0c80c21d7c1aa0f3016ac59899535087d0982ac3ccf7ff6bb7\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"content\\\":[],\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABqxZifbH1l91pkC5seYjcbk9J7dV1dBTdgifYYfz7QPJEf5hLt586IDueB4ApGhRw0iloFR31_FlB6jJZidFiDW670q2GMh6OMxkVr58vTYuD5JeIRQol-T7RKcUUrMKYpagnMy_xEutZ2zrnIeP1jfDlw3AGPFEYD7QnXqzgNHRC1sjGW-SXwa07DX8-alGTtTwcLN6oFiZiubo_nsRLD-VPen2UD_G8kVE8ymJDCZPMO-F_2SftfLPKY1hofCTNBy09gaOyguEvBn_zLYDD_OW_-LcOSqN5ztt6bSF-8fAQURLCAJo5wfNlBFrpafLRSzC-L82max2TzFMx_nHI7ndEaX2LhjEZEFMBzVeFxgPyeJ6F74y0lWnYNIUi3KatbM9ZXMBrTgAMdw94rRr4M4xaZw_xc9fat7EteyNJocsAlO2PpSn05OpjPubgPLTmmAVWzvzOPisqOH65UpNQPdw_yoMR4yHwUqQUZxViVZTvVUJ_yd1263WRYNFzLIC5U-JfzddAwCwMaTy3ssxduG5su0Yi0B_d6hrvC3zR